Package: flanders
Type: Package
Title: Finemapping coLocalization AND plEiotRopy Solver
Version: 2.3.9
Author: Sodbo Sharapov, Arianna Landini, Nicola Pirastu
Maintainer: Sodbo Sharapov <sodbo.sharapov@fht.org>
Description: A tool for fine-mapping, colocalization, and pleiotropy analysis
  in genetic studies. It integrates multiple datasets to identify shared
  genetic signals and provides statistical insights.
